<title>ARGENTINA: Japanese monarchs to visit Argentina - report.</title>
<headline>Japanese monarchs to visit Argentina - report.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Emperor Akihito and Empress Michiko will visit Argentina at the end of May or early in June, the local news agency DyN said on Tuesday, quoting Japanese Embassy sources.</p>
<p>The precise date and details of the official visit will be announced on Friday in Buenos Aires and Tokyo, the agency added.</p>
